<title>USA: Gaming Lottery knows no reason for share decline.</title>
<headline>Gaming Lottery knows no reason for share decline.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaming Lottery Corp said Tuesday it is unaware of any reason for the recent decline in its share price.</p>
<p>The British Virgin Islands-based company noted that it is on schedule to launch the  &quot;beta&quot; test site of its GalaxiWorld Internet gaming and entertainment web site by the end of July.</p>
<p>GalaxiWorld was formed to develop and market a virtual reality three-dimensional digital casino and entertainment website, it said.</p>
<p>Larry Weltman, chief financial officer, said the company is on track with its strategic business plan and in a better position to take advantage of the  on-line gaming market.</p>
</text>
